+/*
+ * Argument block for pidfd_mmap(). Extensible: @size is sizeof(struct) as
+ * known to userspace; the kernel zero-extends older/smaller structs and
+ * rejects unknown non-zero trailing bytes (see copy_struct_from_user()).
